Package: virtualx
Version: 2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, qemu-system-x86, virt-viewer
Maintainer: VirtualX <noreply@example.com>
Description: Run any ISO image as a virtual machine
 VirtualX is a small GTK app with two buttons: Upload ISO and Launch.
 Upload lets you pick any bootable .iso file from your computer.
 Launch boots that ISO in a real QEMU virtual machine and opens it
 in a SPICE display window, so you can use it like a real machine.
